nsi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">영어강좌를 40시간 이상 이수한 자 </span></u><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">(2010년도 입학생까지만 적용)</span></u></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">4. 외국어시험 면제신청 접수기간 및 장소</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; 가. 접수 기간 : </span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">2012. 11. 06(화) ~ 11. 09(금)[4일간]</span></u></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; 나. 접수 장소 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">각 학과 종합학사행정실</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; 다. 면제신청원 양식 : 첨부파일 참조</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">5. 신청 결과 발표 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #008000; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">2012. 11. 19(월)</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"> 원스톱서비스</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; ☞ 경로 : 원스톱서비스 로그인→학사관리→졸업→졸업사정자료 조회</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; </p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><o:p></o:p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 2; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">2012. 10.</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 2; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 2; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">금오공과대학교 대학원(일반 및 컨설팅)장</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
